HealthReadOptimizationTest
├── given arbitrary full-width health and a literal threshold
│   ├── when health meets the threshold
│   │   └── direct tuple extraction and the wrapper return identical executor results
│   └── when health is below the threshold
│       └── both executor recipes reject
├── given zero-debt maximum health
│   └── direct extraction preserves every bit of the uint256 value
└── given health exactly at the threshold
    ├── it passes in both recipes
    └── it fails when the threshold increases by one

HealthReadOptimizationMainnetTest
├── given a real Aave supplied account without debt
│   └── both executor recipes preserve the maximum health value
└── given a real Aave supplied account with USDC debt
    ├── four direct reads produce the same values and threshold checks as four wrapped reads
    ├── direct reads reduce RecipeExecutor.execute gas
    └── a threshold one unit above the native health fails in both recipes
